      "text": "English\nFirst row (header unconfirmed): Column 1: Problem | Column 2: What you can do\nColumn 1: Remote does not control the speakers | Column 2: •Check the battery to be sure it is installed correctly. Refer to the image on page 8. ·Refer to“Tips on using the remote control”on page7.\nColumn 1: PC monitor or TV color patten looks unnatural | Column 2: Turn off the monitor or TV for 15to 30 minutes,then turn it on again. •Move the speakers away from the monitor or TV.",
