      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Controlling the volume\nPress the + and – buttons on the side of the right speaker or on the remote control.\nThe indicator light blinks each time you press + or –. •\nThe indicator light blinks more than once when the • volume reaches its highest or lowest setting.\nBe sure your computer is turned on and EACH of its volume controls is turned up to at least 2/3 maximum and is not muted.",
